Name: octave_data_encryption_standard
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-18
Author: Yu Hongbo <yuhongbo@member.fsf.org>, CNOCTAVE <cnoctave@qq.com>
Maintainer: Yu Hongbo <yuhongbo@member.fsf.org>, CNOCTAVE <cnoctave@qq.com>
Title: DES and 3DES primitives for GNU Octave
Description: Provides DES/3DES-ECB primitives in two bit orders (FIPS 46-3
 and the private order used by QQMusic/LyricTools.exe), plus the complete
 XOR + 3DES + zlib pipeline that decrypts LyricTools.exe .qrc files.
Depends: octave (>= 8.0.0)
License: GPLv3+
Url: https://github.com/CNOCTAVE/octave_data_encryption_standard
